      <title>Binance Details $3.6 Billion in Net Outflows After Cyber Theft</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-01/binance-to-resume-customer-withdrawals-in-phases-after-hack</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">fc6b5b398a04a73410f646a1</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 04:59:43 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Binance posted a net outflow of $3.6 billion in cryptoassets after restoring customer withdrawals on Sunday, a relatively soft blow to its overall business in the wake of the largest cyber theft in history, which has been attributed to North Korean hackers.</description>
